[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 34865.266, "timestamp": "09:41:05", "text": "知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34874.63, "timestamp": "09:41:14", "text": "這種灰塵也讓人難受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34879.83, "timestamp": "09:41:19", "text": "。外設之類的東西總得定期除塵，不過你也知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34909.11, "timestamp": "09:41:49", "text": "我當時想，這真是個好軟體，它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34915.586, "timestamp": "09:41:55", "text": "不是需要重新渲染或重新編碼？"}]